# gta5 map data is generated, never committed.
# tools/export_map.bat writes real placements extracted from a game
# install in here; that is game-derived data and does not belong in a
# public repo. tools/make_test_tiles.py regenerates the stand-in city in
# seconds, so nothing is lost by keeping all of it out.
packages/gta5/assets/
